  "review_scope": "Actual compiled Regular TTF comparison for64selected glyphs:51exact numerical geometries reuse reviewed method proofs and13guard/template-modified glyphs have a new targeted final TTF board. AdditionallyU3D02FandU3F152were compared across the exact five production static masters against the v1.1 variable font, and the deliberate Dao design had separate48pxRegular/96pxRegular/Bold review. Not a full-repertoire visual review.",
  "findings": [
    "The final held-path/shared-template differences retain legibility, visible counter openings and earlier optical sizing in all13targeted samples.",
    "Long-axis bars such as土now use clean straight chords without the former wavy/downturned tip.",
    "Dao is visibly simplified through geometric stems, bowl corners and matching repeated curves while preserving its15source paths and intentional opening.",
    "Other glyphs receive bounded curve/axis cleanup; their historical character structures and complex stroke counts remain.",
    "U3D02Flegacy fallback is visually acceptable at300/400/500/600/700: round caps, joins, four upper counters and petal/stem structure remain clear; no new cap blob or disconnected stroke was seen.",
    "U3F152legacyfallback is visually acceptable at300/400/500/600/700: water strokes remain separated, the open upper form and lower rounded counter remain clear, and no new cap blob or break is visible. Its exact production outlines have318contours perweight, zero degenerate contours, and minimum analytic/control areas24/30/36/43/50fu²."
  ],
